===== crossing tax 0 ns per forward entry-point call =====
CROSSING TAX: 0 iterations = -0.01 ns per forward entry-point call (asked for 0.0). Every forward call in the binding pays it, so the
crossing is priced up and the batching verdict can be read as a crossover rather than as a fact about a 1.85 ns crossing.

